    <string name="iching_tip_5">The first toss is the bottom line and the sixth is the top — the hexagram builds from the bottom up.</string>
    <string name="iching_tip_6">Changing lines signal change: old yin turns yang and old yang turns yin, forming the changed hexagram.</string>
